Copyright its authors, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Modifications, all under the same license:
- pyproject.toml: OpenUSD from conda-forge on aarch64 Linux.
- src/articraft/agent/provider/openrouter.py, src/articraft/settings.py, src/articraft/api.py,
  src/articraft/app.py, .env.example, docs/providers.md: drive a local OpenAI-compatible server
  (base URL, optional key, image input, output cap, chat-template arguments, image pruning, and a
  per-turn thinking budget enforced by the client).
- src/articraft/agent/harness.py, src/articraft/agent/record.py: keep the last clean compile when a
  run reaches its turn limit.
- tests/: tests for the above.
- spark/: new; install, serve, demo, scoring and rendering scripts for an NVIDIA DGX Spark.
- README.md: new. Articraft's own README is preserved as ARTICRAFT.md.

The model weights are not part of this repository. RedHatAI/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-NVFP4 is downloaded from
Hugging Face under its own license.
